  "_rule_junction": "Junction hue = midpoint of the shorter arc between the founder-lane hue and the paradigm band hue. When the two are near-complementary (|d| > 150) the midpoint is unstable, so the boundary color appears at a right angle to both (founder_hue + 90 * sign(d)) — Goethe's polar rule: light and dark meet and the color that appears is in neither.",
